  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Refreshed <strong>August 18, 2026</strong>. Searched Cars.com, CarGurus, and AutoTrader \nfor 4-seat convertibles within 35 miles of Media, PA (19063), $7,000\u2013$15,000. \nTrueCar was skipped (broken body filter). Applied 2-seat roadster deny list \n(MX-5, Boxster, Z3/Z4, TT Roadster, Thunderbird, Saturn Sky, SL-Class, etc.) and personal \nexclude list (MINI, Buick, Solara, Camaro, pre-2005 Mustang, Volvo). \n<strong>Cars.com:</strong> 26 total found, 12 kept after filters. \n<strong>CarGurus:</strong> ~21 listed, 12 kept. \n<strong>AutoTrader:</strong> 60 total found, 19 kept after filters (pages 1\u20132). \nNo manual-transmission 4-seat convertibles were found in budget this refresh \u2014 see Manual tab for details. \nImage coverage: Cars.com 100%, CarGurus 100%, AutoTrader 100%.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2013,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "328i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 13594,
        "mileage": 51386,
        "location": "Elkton, MD",
        "dealer": "Hertrich Ford of Elkton",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/3094de18-2817-450f-8d08-bbd5b066a7ec/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/d97d9dd8-6840-54d3-8234-e6e0a1ae09bc/0074da54-05f1-4115-9857-6cbed777ab54/uNy8XgkILSRgGWQtSDmy9jeeT8Y.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The F30-era 328i Cabriolet hits the sweet spot of sport, reliability, and desirability. At 51k miles it still has most of its life ahead of it. BMW's N26/N20 four-cylinder is robust; the E-frame chassis is tight and fun. Clean title, no accidents per listing.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle (up and down, verify latch clicks closed); check headliner and rear carpet for water staining; inspect rocker panels for rust bubbling; listen for oil leaks at valve cover and oil pan; verify soft-top rear window clarity; 8.8 rear axle clunk on launch.",
        "bottomLine": "Best-value modern BMW 3-series convertible in the batch \u2014 low miles, reliable platform, fun to drive."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2012,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A5",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium Plus",
        "price": 12999,
        "mileage": 55600,
        "location": "Fairless Hills, PA",
        "dealer": "Peruzzi Mazda",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/787462594",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/1b827306786d42be982805eff02276e5.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The B8 A5 Cabriolet is one of the handsomest 4-seat convertibles ever made. 56k miles on the 2.0T TFSI is very reasonable, Premium Plus trim means heated seats and Bang & Olufsen audio. Audi build quality on a solid platform.",
        "whatToVerify": "A5 soft-top mechanism: exercise full cycle, check hydraulic fluid level and rear window zip track; inspect B pillars and sills for rust; 2.0T TFSI timing chain tensioner (TSB applies to pre-2013); check multifunction display for error codes; transmission fluid fresh or scheduled.",
        "bottomLine": "Stunning 4-seat cabriolet at a bargain price \u2014 the A5 at $13k with 56k miles is a genuine find."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2013,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "128i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 9000,
        "mileage": 84625,
        "location": "Broomall, PA",
        "dealer": "Private Seller Exchange",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/788093671",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://assets.cai-media-management.com/ps-vehicle-media/95b2a6f7-ade6-42d8-8390-162c4f1b2218.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "The E88 128i is the driver's choice: lighter than a 3-series, rear-wheel drive, perfectly balanced. At $9k for an 85k-mile 2013 in Broomall PA (very close to Media), this is exceptional value. Transmission unconfirmed \u2014 could be 6-speed manual.",
        "whatToVerify": "Confirm manual vs. automatic (huge difference in fun factor \u2014 check VIN decoder or call seller). Full top cycle; rear window seam check; oil service history; rocker panel rust (salt state); cam timing chain health on N52 six.",
        "bottomLine": "A stone's throw from Media at a price well below market \u2014 verify the transmission first, then jump on it."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2020,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "Premium",
        "price": 14995,
        "mileage": 132770,
        "location": "Langhorne, PA",
        "dealer": "Fred Beans Ford of Langhorne",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/786146269",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/222fd6cf16b74417965cb982182e7e8b.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The S550-gen Mustang (2015+) is mechanically modern \u2014 independent rear suspension, advanced electronics, far more refined than the SN-197. A 2020 Premium at under $15k is rare; 133k miles on an EcoBoost or GT is livable. Fred Beans is a reputable regional dealer.",
        "whatToVerify": "Confirm engine (EcoBoost 4-cyl vs. GT V8 \u2014 check VIN 8th position: F=EcoBoost, R=5.0 GT); soft-top rear camera function; water staining on rear seats (common top-seal issue); check for MT-82 transmission rattle if manual; rear camera and infotainment POD.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern Mustang convertible in the batch from a real dealer \u2014 great daily driver and fun second car."
      },
      {
        "rank": 5,
        "year": 2015,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "435i xDrive",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 8500,
        "mileage": 140389,
        "location": "Marlton, NJ",
        "dealer": "Private Seller Exchange",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/754834213",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://assets.cai-media-management.com/ps-vehicle-media/640316c0-126a-41a5-997b-6ae6b6bd6dd2.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "The F33 435i is the 3-series cabriolet's spiritual successor \u2014 N55 3.0L twin-scroll turbo inline-6 producing 300hp. xDrive AWD makes it usable year-round. $8,500 is a steep discount from MSRP of $60k+. The N55 engine is more reliable than the S55.",
        "whatToVerify": "N55 oil leaks (valve cover, oil filter housing, coolant hose lower); soft-top hydraulic cylinder condition (inspect pump under rear parcel shelf); rocker rust on AWD models salted in winter; all four windows function; iDrive screen dead-pixel check.",
        "bottomLine": "Twin-turbo inline-6 AWD convertible at $8,500 is genuinely impressive \u2014 miles are high but the N55 takes it."
      },
      {
        "rank": 6,
        "year": 2016,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium",
        "price": 12999,
        "mileage": 83000,
        "location": "Whitemarsh, PA",
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/268b9c8c-307d-4ec3-b1fc-dca4c871e230/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/p2p/0cb11156-d4b9-4b04-b292-c2f8153b0994/a868667f-4021-4b17-9e2d-ba6d653f48ab.JPG",
        "whyGood": "The 8V Audi A3 Cabriolet is the most practical small convertible available. Clean title, no accidents. 83k miles on the 2.0T is fine with documented service. Whitemarsh PA is close to Media. Private party means negotiation room.",
        "whatToVerify": "2.0T EA888 timing chain tensioner (check for TSB); confirm DSG vs. S-tronic transmission service interval; top mechanism full cycle; check for water in passenger footwell (A3 sunroof drain path runs past blower); VAG scan for stored codes.",
        "bottomLine": "A clean private-party A3 Cabriolet near Media at $13k \u2014 small, fun, and Audi-practical."
      },
      {
        "rank": 7,
        "year": 2010,
        "make": "Lexus",
        "model": "IS 250C",
        "trim": "Base",
        "price": 12950,
        "mileage": 124762,
        "location": "Norristown, PA",
        "dealer": "New Concept Inc",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/f7d54151-c2eb-4bbb-a4f7-710d3cfe2836/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/5631252c-0139-5d87-8647-26d44957f0e7/d35e8904-3dc0-469b-9e8f-e5091f2e12a4/VOyBnZtgK6xfBPE7yxnVu8esqFs.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The IS 250C has the most reliable retractable hardtop (RHT) of any convertible in this price range \u2014 Lexus engineered it to near-bulletproof spec. The 2.5L V6 is essentially unbreakable. Great interior quality and Toyota/Lexus long-term ownership experience.",
        "whatToVerify": "RHT mechanism: full cycle open and close, listen for hesitation or grinding; check rear seat when folded down (mechanism uses that space); trunk seal water-tightness; inspect under tonneau cover for moisture; confirm service history especially ATF and brake fluid.",
        "bottomLine": "The most reliable hardtop convertible in the batch \u2014 Lexus quality at $13k is extraordinary value."
      },
      {
        "rank": 8,
        "year": 2012,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": null,
        "price": 9459,
        "mileage": 96539,
        "location": null,
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cargurus",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/445737422",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/04/30/14/23/2012_ford_mustang-pic-2949931544508764713-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "2012 Mustang convertible at $9,459 with 96k miles is excellent value in the S197 generation. 9 miles from Media PA. The 3.7L V6 (or GT 5.0) are both solid; either way this is a true American muscle convertible that's fun on summer back roads.",
        "whatToVerify": "Confirm V6 vs. GT (VIN decode); top mechanism full cycle and latch seating; rear seat water stain (check below rear quarter windows); inspect spring perches for rust (common S197 issue); 8.8 axle sniff for gear oil; all accessories working.",
        "bottomLine": "Best-value Mustang in the batch at $9,459 \u2014 only 9 miles away, worth a drive over today."
      },
      {
        "rank": 9,
        "year": 2011,
        "make": "Chrysler",
        "model": "200",
        "trim": "Touring",
        "price": 10467,
        "mileage": 54336,
        "location": null,
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cargurus",
