        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/14/12/05/2011_chrysler_200-pic-5719688845023663115-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "Just 1 mile from Media, 54k miles, $10.5k \u2014 the Chrysler 200 Convertible is not exotic but it's genuinely comfortable, roomy, and affordable to maintain. This is the easy-going summer cruiser pick.",
        "whatToVerify": "Chrysler 200 top is a cloth soft-top: check rear window delamination and seam stitching; power window regulators (common failure); 3.6L Pentastar (if equipped) oil consumption test; check for any TIPM (totally integrated power module) electrical gremlins by testing all lighting and accessories.",
        "bottomLine": "A no-drama, affordable convertible a mile from home \u2014 perfect for casual warm-weather driving."
